Tezbar standalone timers Rust extension

Extracted and adapted from Tezbar, baseline fe71ca87f21ac4ff31505010c228f8abda0f2a89.
App-derived Rust and helper source is Apache-2.0: see LICENSE.
Behavior and original artwork derive from the installed Raycast extension.
Raycast extension source is MIT: see licenses/raycast-extensions-MIT.txt.
Original author and source provenance: SOURCE.json and extension.json.
Installed bundle revision is unknown; current upstream metadata in provenance
must not be represented as the installed revision.

Original installed command icon is retained without a new ownership claim.
The six upstream Mixkit recordings are NOT included. Their source-file/tool
redistribution restrictions do not establish permission to publish them here.
No MIT license claim is made for those recordings. The six files shipped here
are new synthesized triangle-wave melodies, generated from integer arithmetic
by scripts/generate_tones.py, licensed under Apache-2.0 with this port.
Historic filenames are compatibility preference identifiers only. These are
new sounds, audibly different from the old recordings; no recording was sampled.
